---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
import { owner } from '../data/owner.mjs';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Terms of Use | CheckVitalsNow"
  description="The terms that apply when you use CheckVitalsNow, including medical and affiliate disclaimers, intellectual property, and limits of liability."
  h1="Terms of Use"
>
  <p>
    These Terms of Use apply to your use of {site.name} ({site.url.replace('https://', '')}){owner.name && <>, operated by {owner.name}</>}.
    By using the site, you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the site.
  </p>

  <h2>Information only, not medical advice</h2>
  <p>
    All content on {site.name} is for general information only and is not medical advice. Always talk to a qualified
    health professional before starting a supplement or changing your treatment. See our
    <a href="/medical-disclaimer/">medical disclaimer</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Affiliate links and third-party sites</h2>
  <p>
    Some links on the site are affiliate links, as explained in our <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">affiliate
    disclosure</a>. Links take you to websites we do not own or control. We are not responsible for their content,
    products, prices, shipping, refunds, or privacy practices. Any purchase you make is between you and the seller.
  </p>

  <h2>Accuracy of information</h2>
  <p>
    We work to keep our content accurate, but product formulas, prices, guarantees, and research change. Content is
    provided "as is," without warranties of any kind, and we do not guarantee that it is complete, current, or free of
    errors. Confirm important details, such as price and refund terms, on the seller's official website.
  </p>

  <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
  <p>
    The text, design, and original graphics on {site.name} belong to us or are used with permission. You may read,
    share links to, and quote short passages from our content with credit and a link back. Please do not copy or
    republish whole articles without written permission. Product names, logos, and packaging shown on the site belong
    to their respective owners and are used only to identify the products we review.
  </p>

  <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
  <p>
    Do not use the site in a way that breaks the law, harms the site or other users, or tries to get around its security,
    including heavy automated scraping.
  </p>

  <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
  <p>
    To the fullest extent allowed by law, {site.name} and the people who run it are not liable for any loss or damage
    that results from your use of the site or from relying on its content, including decisions about supplements or
    purchases from third-party sellers.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
  <p>
    We may update these terms. The "Last updated" date at the top shows when they last changed. Continuing to use the
    site after a change means you accept the new terms.
  </p>

  {
    owner.jurisdiction && (
      <>
        <h2>Governing law</h2>
        <p>These terms are governed by the laws of {owner.jurisdiction}.</p>
      </>
    )
  }

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about these terms? Reach us through our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
</PageLayout>
